0,Lamaholot people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamaholot_people,"November 29, 2025 - The Lamaholot language belongs to the Malayo-Polynesian languages of the Austronesian language family.",Lamaholot,Austronesian
