2,"(PDF) L'énigme des duos alternés à Flores et Solor (Lamaholot, Indonésie) (2010)",https://www.academia.edu/5301167/Lénigme_des_duos_alternés_à_Flores_et_Solor_Lamaholot_Indonésie_2010_,"July 25, 2014 - An unusual kind of music was discovered in Flores in the 1930s and was partially described and recorded in the 1990s. This subtle art is still performed nowadays in many villages from Tana ‘Ai to Tanjung Bunga in eastern Flores, some 80 km ...",Lamaholot,Austronesian
